WEBVTT

00:00:00.162 --> 00:00:04.491
Open Photo capture and turn it on for this video part.

00:00:04.491 --> 00:00:11.289
Choose when to capture, then set a short flash and a three-second hold.

00:00:11.289 --> 00:00:14.609
Move the playhead into the held photo to see your changes.

00:00:14.609 --> 00:00:23.593
Tilt the photo, make it smaller and add a white border.

00:00:23.593 --> 00:00:30.235
Custom frame picks the area to photograph, and Apply keeps that crop.

00:00:30.235 --> 00:00:43.433
Press Play: the video flashes, pauses on the tilted, framed photo, then moves on.
